Related to (and arguably a dupe of) #987

```php
class O {}
class A extends O {}
class B extends O {}

$a = rand(0, 1) ? new A : new B;

if ($a instanceof A) {
} elseif ($a instanceof A) {} // this is an error

function foo(O $o) {
    if ($o instanceof A) {
    } elseif ($o instanceof A) {} // this should be an error, but isn't
}
```
https://phpstan.org/r/657d4486ff8ba67136a61fc4c8d14466

The only foolproof way to solve this is to have some notion of algebraic assertions
